## What the page of the demo adds

The web build of CGP generates its own page, designed for a full browser window. The file `slide-frame.html`
replaces it, and adds the following elements:

- it fills the frame, whatever the size of the window created by the program;
- it sends the arrow keys and Page Down / Page Up to the slides, even after a click in the demo;
- it fades the demo in once its first frames are drawn, and indicates when it is ready (useful for a PDF export);
- it keeps the image of the canvas, so that it can be captured (for the poster, and for the tests).

